# caddy:alpine hasn't been rebuilt against a patched Go toolchain yet —
# confirmed 2026-09-18 by checking caddy:alpine, caddy:2-alpine and
# caddy:2.11-alpine all resolve to the same digest (Caddy v2.11.4). There is
# nothing to change on our side until upstream rebuilds; remove entries here
# as each stops appearing in a scan (meaning caddy:alpine has caught up).
